### Register for Event (Supports coupons & waitlist)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "eventId": "66d000000000000000000001",
  "ticketId": "66d000000000000000000021",
  "couponCode": "TECHVIP20"
}

### Cancel Registration (Promotes waitlisted attendee)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/registrations/66d000000000000000000031/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
